{
  "title": "Microservices Scraper Pipeline",
  "uid": "microservices-scraper-main",
  "tags": ["microservices", "scraper", "kafka", "pipeline"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Total Requests by Service",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(service_requests_total[1m])) by (service)",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "reqps"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "mean"]
        },
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Request Success Rate",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(service_requests_total{status=\"success\"}) / sum(service_requests_total) * 100",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"value": 0, "color": "red"},
              {"value": 90, "color": "yellow"},
              {"value": 95, "color": "green"}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "graphMode": "area",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Total Requests Processed",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(service_requests_total)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"value": 0, "color": "blue"}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "graphMode": "area",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Request Duration (p50, p95, p99)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(service_request_duration_seconds_bucket[1m])) by (service, le))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(service_request_duration_seconds_bucket[1m])) by (service, le))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} p95",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(service_request_duration_seconds_bucket[1m])) by (service, le))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} p99",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 0
          },
          "unit": "s"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Average Response Time by Service",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(service_request_duration_seconds_sum[1m]) / rate(service_request_duration_seconds_count[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} - {{operation}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 15
          },
          "unit": "s"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "mean"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Service Status (Up/Down)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 16},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(up{job=~\".*service.*\"} == 1)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"value": 0, "color": "red"},
              {"value": 1, "color": "green"}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "mappings": []
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "graphMode": "none",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Memory Usage by Service",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 6, "y": 16},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "process_resident_memory_bytes{job=~\".*service.*\"} / 1024 / 1024",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "unit": "decmbytes"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "CPU Usage by Service",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 16},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(process_cpu_seconds_total{job=~\".*service.*\"}[1m]) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "unit": "percent",
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "mean"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Pipeline Overview",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 24},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## 🔄 Scraping Pipeline Flow\n\n**API Gateway** → **Analyzer Service** → Kafka (`analysis-results`) → **Scraper Service** → Kafka (`scraped-products`) → **ETL Service** → MySQL Database\n\n---\n\n### Current Status\n- ✅ Services are running and processing requests\n- 📊 Monitoring active on all microservices\n- 🔍 Check individual panels for detailed metrics"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Request Rate Breakdown",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 28},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(service_requests_total) by (service, status)",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} - {{status}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"value": 0, "color": "green"}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "showUnfilled": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Open File Descriptors",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 28},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "process_open_fds{job=~\".*service.*\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth"
          },
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
